\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Eternal Son, eternal Love,
\par Take to Thyself Thy mighty power;
\par Let all earth's sons Thy mercy prove,
\par Let all Thy saving grace begun.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. The triumphs of Thy love display,
\par In every heart reign Thou alone,
\par Till all Thy foes confess Thy sway,
\par And glory ends what grace begun.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Spirit of grace, and health, and power, 
\par Fountain of light and love below,
\par Abroad Thy healing influence shower,
\par O'er all the nations let it flow.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Inflame our hearts with perfect love,
\par In us the work of faith fulfil;
\par So not heaven's host shall swifter move
\par Then we on earth, to do Thy will.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Blessing and honour, praise and love,
\par Co-equal, co-eternal Three,
\par In earth below, and heaven above,
\par By all Thy works be paid to Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Thrice Holy! Thine the kingdom is,
\par The power omnipotent is Thine;
\par And when creature nature dies,
\par Thy never-ceasing glories shine.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

